msgid ""
"Endgame: Singularity is a simulation of a true AI.  Pursued by the world, use your intellect and resources to survive and, perhaps, thrive.  Keep hidden and you might have a chance to prove your worth.\n"
"\n"
"A game by Evil Mr Henry and Phil Bordelon; released under the GPL. Copyright 2005, 2006, 2007, 2008.\n"
"\n"
"Website: http://www.emhsoft.com/singularity/\n"
"Source code: https://github.com/singularity/singularity\n"
"Bug tracker: https://github.com/singularity/singularity/issues\n"
"IRC Room: #singularity on irc.oftc.net (port 6667)\n"
"\n"
"Version {VERSION}"
msgstr ""
"Endgame: Singularity je simulacija prave veštačke inteligencije. Dok te svet progoni, koristi pamet i resurse da preživiš i, možda, napreduješ. Ostani skriven i možda ćeš imati priliku da dokažeš svoju vrednost.\n"
"\n"
"Igru su napravili Evil Mr Henry i Phil Bordelon; objavljena je pod GPL. Autorska prava 2005, 2006, 2007, 2008.\n"
"\n"
"Sajt: http://www.emhsoft.com/singularity/\n"
"Izvorni kod: https://github.com/singularity/singularity\n"
"Praćenje grešaka: https://github.com/singularity/singularity/issues\n"
"IRC soba: #singularity na irc.oftc.net (port 6667)\n"
"\n"
"Izdanje {VERSION}"

